Experiment 6 – Manage Kubernetes Resources Using CLI
1. Commands Used
Step 1: Verify Docker
docker --version


Step 2: Verify kubectl
kubectl version --client


Step 3: Verify Minikube
minikube version


Step 4: Start Minikube
minikube start --driver=docker


Step 5: Verify cluster
minikube status
kubectl get nodes


Step 6: Create Pod YAML file
notepad nginx-pod.yaml


Step 7: Apply Pod configuration
kubectl apply -f nginx-pod.yaml


Step 8: Check Pod
kubectl get pods


Step 9: Describe Pod
kubectl describe pod nginx-pod


Step 10: Forward Pod port
kubectl port-forward pod/nginx-pod 8081:80


Open in browser:
http://localhost:8081


Step 11: Delete Pod

Press Ctrl + C to stop port forwarding.
kubectl delete pod nginx-pod
